                     <title>Codex Iustiniani (bks. i--ix)</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Has a note on flyleaf about 1300 concerning a
                        dispute and mentioning the Abbot of Oseney. Entertaning but rough
                        illumination. Mermaids, ant's eye view of horses, ladies with single spots
                        of rouge on their cheeks. Not in Powicke.</note>
                  </msItem>
